      hu: ["A park a Flag-szigeten található, Sharjah városának szívében.", "A létesítmény korábban Al Jazeera Park néven volt ismert.", "A Pearls Kingdom 35 különböző vízi csúszdával és látványossággal rendelkezik.", "Az Island of Legends 26 különböző legendán alapuló játékot kínál.", "A park teljes területe megközelítőleg 126 000 négyzetméter.", "A modernizáció utáni nagy újranyitásra 2014-ben került sor."],
      ro: ["Parcul este situat pe Flag Island, în inima orașului Sharjah.", "În trecut, complexul a fost cunoscut sub numele de Parcul Al Jazeera.", "Pearls Kingdom oferă 35 de tobogane și atracții acvatice diferite.", "Island of Legends include carusele bazate pe 26 de legende globale.", "Parcul se întinde pe o suprafață totală de 126.000 de metri pătrați.", "Marea redeschidere după modernizare a avut loc în anul 2014."],
      en: ["The park is situated on Flag Island in the heart of Sharjah city.", "The facility was formerly known as Al Jazeera Park before its renovation.", "Pearls Kingdom features 35 different water slides and attractions.", "Island of Legends is an amusement park themed around global folktales.", "The park covers a total area of approximately 126,000 square meters.", "The major renovation and rebranding project was completed in 2014."],
